# Air Response Unit (3/3 flying, vigilance Vehicle, Crew 1): "total power 1 or more" (CR 702.122a) needs a creature you control. Bot1's
# Aegis Turtle has power 0 and Bot2's Savannah Lions has power 2, so neither can crew it; Bot1's Zephyr Sprite (power 1, summoning
# sick, which does not matter for a crew cost) can. The crewed Unit attacks in the air for 3 and, with vigilance, is not tapped by it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Air Response Unit
Aegis Turtle
Zephyr Sprite
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
Island x18

